---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="About" description="Who this is and what the site is for.">
  <header class="page-header">
    <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
    <h1>Hi, I'm Yousif.</h1>
  </header>

  <div class="prose">
    <p>
      This is my public notebook. I use it to think out loud about things I'm
      reading, building, and trying to understand — and to leave a trail of how
      those ideas change over time.
    </p>
    <p>
      The format is deliberately simple: short entries, grouped into categories,
      published as I go rather than polished until they're "ready". Expect rough
      edges and corrections in later posts.
    </p>
    <h2>What you'll find here</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Reading logs</strong> — currently one page a day from an AI book, with notes on what stuck.</li>
      <li><strong>Build notes</strong> — projects and experiments, including the failures.</li>
      <li><strong>Ideas in progress</strong> — half-formed thinking, open questions, things I'm changing my mind about.</li>
    </ul>
    <!-- TODO: add your preferred contact links (email, GitHub, socials) below -->
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      Want to get in touch? Add your preferred contact method in this section of
      <code>src/pages/about.astro</code>.
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>
